selected 2, first 7, next 9
--- header
insert 0 1 0
count 3
  0: width 30 param 33 order 0 spans 0..30 text: "Zero"
  1: width 50 param 11 order 1 spans 30..80 text: "One"
  2: width 70 param 22 order 2 spans 80..150 text: "Two"
set order 1
item 0 now spans 70..100, order 0 is item 2
hit at x 5: 2 item 2
delete 1, then 3 items
--- tree view
